{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone! My name is Sergio, I am the author of <i>Hearthlands</i>, <i>Elsewhere</i>, and <i>YogLabs: Testing Initiative</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a collection of music tracks from my games released between 2005 and 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All music tracks in this collection were either written or commissioned by me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102510/extras/90b6b15c70f90abc46f09637b9ae7aab.avif?t=1760643055\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This collection includes all songs from Hearthlands, songs from older games, and several unreleased tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many tracks were expanded and re-recorded specially for this collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's also a pdf-file with some information about each track and the game it was made for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102510/extras/c2653c05ac0891fff12c2b130b4f3748.avif?t=1760643055\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm not expecting this album to top the charts, but if you like my games and want to help me carry on, getting this collection is a good way to do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was fun going back 20 years and remembering how my career started - I hope you'll have as much fun listening to this album!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102510?t=1760643055","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102510?t=1760643055","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s